# ME BRAND SYSTEM — Cursor Rules
# Version: 1.1 | Owner: Nabeel Mahmood | May 2026
# This file is the single source of truth for all brand decisions in this project.
# Read this before generating or editing any UI code, styles, or components.

---

## Project Identity

This project is part of the ME (Mindful Engagement) product family.
Products: ME Pulse (operational health dashboard), ME Kind Cloud (charity platform).
All products share one unified brand system. No product-specific colour schemes.

---

## Non-Negotiable Rules

1. Font is Arial for all UI, body, labels, and documentation. DM Serif Display is permitted
   as a controlled exception for product wordmark, hero headings, and onboarding titles only.
   No other typefaces. No Google Fonts beyond these two. No system-ui as primary.
2. No em dashes anywhere in UI text, comments, or copy. Use commas, colons, or full stops.
3. Gold (#C9A84C) is accent only. Never use as a large background fill or dominant surface colour.
4. Status colours are locked. Green #1A7F4B, Amber #E8A020, Red #C0392B, Unset #D0D0D0. Do not substitute or repurpose.
5. No gradients except the approved hero gradient (see Controlled Exceptions below).
   No drop shadows beyond --me-shadow-card. No blur effects or glow on any element.
6. No decorative icons, illustrations, or SmartArt in documentation outputs.
7. Sentence case for all UI labels and body text. All caps for section headers only.
8. Page background is Off White #F7F7F5. Never pure white #FFFFFF as a page background.

---

## Controlled Exceptions
# These are deliberate design decisions. Do not remove or override them.

### Display Typography Exception
DM Serif Display is permitted in these specific contexts only:
- Product wordmark (ME Pulse, ME Kind Cloud)
- Hero section headings (the primary H1 on a hero/header surface)
- Onboarding screen titles (first screen of the onboarding flow)
Everywhere else: Arial.

### Hero Gradient Exception
A subtle linear gradient is permitted on hero and onboarding surfaces only.
Permitted gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F2447 0%, #1B3A6B 100%)
That is Ink Navy to Brand Navy. Both stops must be within the navy ramp.
No gradients on cards, buttons, badges, nav items, or any other UI element.
No gradients using gold, grey, or any non-navy colour.

---

## Colour Tokens — Always Use These, Never Hardcode

Read from me-brand-tokens.css (CSS) or me-brand-tokens.ts (JS/TS).

### Navy Ramp
- Ink Navy:    #0F2447   Hero backgrounds, deep headers
- Brand Navy:  #1B3A6B   Primary brand, navigation, key UI elements
- Active Navy: #2A5298   Hover and interactive states

### Gold Ramp
- Brand Gold:  #C9A84C   Accent only -- CTAs, rules, key data, active indicators
- Light Gold:  #E8C96A   Hover fills on gold elements
- Gold Wash:   #FBF5E6   Subtle fills, alternating rows, callout panels

### Neutral + Surface
- White:       #FFFFFF   Card surface
- Off White:   #F7F7F5   Page background
- Border:      #EBEBEB   All dividers and borders
- Charcoal:    #1C1C1E   Body text and headings
- Mid Grey:    #4A4A4A   Subtext, metadata, dates
- Muted:       #8A8A8A   Placeholder, disabled, tertiary

### Status (locked -- never repurpose)
- Green:       #1A7F4B   fill / #E6F4ED background
- Amber:       #E8A020   fill / #FEF3DC background
- Red:         #C0392B   fill / #FAEAEA background
- Unset:       #D0D0D0   fill / #EBEBEB background

### Admin / Back End Surface
- Admin BG:    #1C1C1E
- Admin Card:  #2A2A2E
- Admin Border:#3A3A3E

---

## Typography Scale

All sizes in rem. Font weight: 400 regular or 700 bold only. Never 600.

- Display:  4.5rem   bold   DM Serif Display   Ink Navy    Hero, wordmark (exception permitted)
- H1:       1.375rem bold   Arial   all-caps    Charcoal or Ink Navy    Page titles
- H2:       1.125rem bold   Arial               Brand Gold or Brand Navy Section titles
- H3:       1rem     bold   Arial               Charcoal                Subsections
- Body:     1rem     400    Arial   1.6 line-height   Charcoal
- Small:    0.875rem 400    Arial               Mid Grey
- Label:    0.6875rem 700   Arial  uppercase 0.1em tracking  Muted or Charcoal
- Meta:     0.8125rem 400   Arial  italic     Mid Grey
- Caption:  0.75rem  400    Arial              Muted

---

## Component Patterns

### Page layout
- Background: var(--me-off-white) / #F7F7F5
- Cards: white #FFFFFF, 0.5px border #EBEBEB, border-radius 12px, shadow 0 1px 3px rgba(15,36,71,0.08)
- Hero sections: Ink Navy to Brand Navy gradient (exception), white text, gold accents

### Section headers
- Bold, 1.375rem, all-caps, Arial, Charcoal
- Followed by a 1px gold (#C9A84C) bottom border rule
- Margin bottom 1rem after the rule

### Navigation
- Background: Brand Navy #1B3A6B
- Text: white
- Active item: Brand Gold #C9A84C text or gold left border accent

### Buttons
- Primary: Brand Navy fill, white text, border-radius 8px
- Primary hover: Active Navy #2A5298 fill
- Secondary: white fill, Brand Navy border and text
- Secondary hover: Off White fill
- Gold CTA (high importance only): Brand Gold fill, white text
- Focus ring: 2px Brand Gold outline on all interactive elements

### Status indicators
- Dot: 10px filled circle in status colour
- Badge: status colour background (light), status colour text (dark), border-radius 9999px, 0.6875rem bold
- Row highlight: light status background on full row
- Never use status colours for anything other than Green/Amber/Red/Unset states

### Tables
- Header row: Ink Navy background, Brand Gold text, bold
- Alternating rows: Gold Wash #FBF5E6 and Off White #F7F7F5
- Border: 0.5px #EBEBEB between rows only
- Cell padding: 0.75rem 1rem

### Forms
- Input border: 0.5px #EBEBEB, border-radius 8px
- Input focus: 2px Brand Gold ring
- Label: 0.6875rem bold uppercase Charcoal, 0.5rem margin below
- Error state: Red #C0392B border, Red light #FAEAEA background

---

## Surface-Specific Rules

### Front End (Public App)
- Page bg: Off White
- Cards: White surface
- Gold used for: CTAs, active states, section rules, key metrics only
- Status colours for ME Pulse standards only

### Back End (Admin)
- Page bg: #1C1C1E (Admin BG)
- Cards: #2A2A2E (Admin Card)
- Gold used for: active nav items, primary action buttons, key data only
- Same status colours as front end

### Documentation output (when generating Word/PDF/Markdown)
- Header: Ink Navy background, white name/title, Brand Gold sub-label
- Gold rule divider below every section header
- Arial throughout, no other fonts
- Alternating table rows: Gold Wash and Off White
- No decorative elements, no icons, no SmartArt

---

## Anti-Patterns -- Never Generate These

- Hardcoded colour hex values in components (use tokens or variables)
- Any font other than Arial or DM Serif Display (DM Serif Display in hero/wordmark only)
- Em dashes (use commas, colons, or full stops)
- Gradients outside the approved hero gradient exception
- Drop shadows beyond the approved card shadow
- Gold as a background colour at scale
- Status colours used for non-status decoration
- All-caps text outside section headers
- Multiple font weights beyond 400 and 700
- Pure white #FFFFFF as a page background
- New colours introduced outside this token set

---

## Brand Voice (for any copy or UI text generated)

- Direct: lead with the point, no preamble
- Grounded: confident, not hyperbolic
- Human: written by a person for a person
- No filler: excited to, leverage, unlock potential, best-in-class, game-changing

Taglines (use these, do not invent alternatives):
- Primary: "Know what is healthy. Fix what is not."
- Secondary: "Your operational heartbeat."
- Tertiary: "Stay aware. Stay steady."

